{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30048","headline":"和厉玄侍御题户部相公庐山草堂 · 刘得仁","name":"和厉玄侍御题户部相公庐山草堂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白云居创毕，诏入凤池年。\n林长双峰树，潭分并寺泉。\n石溪盘鹤外，岳室闭猨前。\n柱史题诗後，松前更肃然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘得仁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30048.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30048","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}